
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# type:    feat | fix | docs | refactor | test | ci | chore
# scope:   optional, one of hooks, rules, gate, eval, plugin, readme
# subject: imperative, lowercase, no period, at most 72 characters
#
# Body (optional, after one blank line): why the change was made.
# One paragraph per line, no hard wrapping, no em dashes.
# Never add Co-authored-by lines.
#
# Examples:
#   feat(hooks): inject rules on session start and a reminder per prompt
#   fix(eval): count only real words and catch prose that runs into a list
